<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89081" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσενεκτέον</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσφέρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must
				apply, administer, offer</i>, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ σώματι] σιτία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>MM</u>
					1199b29
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.372
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				2.61
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσφέρομαι</span>) <i>one must deal with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράως τοῖς οἰκέταις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					34
				</span></i>
			/<i><span class="en">
				5.2.33
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς συγγενέσιν τοῖς πολίταις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Epict.</u>
					p.89
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δήμῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
				</span></i>
			 (i.e. Constant. <i>pro Them.</i>) <i><span class="en">
				p.20c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσενεκτέος, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
					<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <i>to be
				administered</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				2
			</span></i>.</div>
